Get one project by id or slug

Usage:
  mdr project get <id> [flags]

Arguments:
  <id>   project id (8-char base62) or slug

Global flags (-o, --fields, --full, --dry-run, ...): see mdr --help

Output fields (default; all: mdr schema project get):
  id, slug, title, description, project_type, downloads, followers, categories, loaders, license.id,
  client_side, server_side, status, updated, team, source_url

Examples:
  mdr project get sodium
  mdr project get sodium --full

API: GET /project/{id|slug}
